# Purpose: Refresh the cjxl parity ledger after W44-54 (DC LearnTree port,
# kyqsvpurqpqq, commit d53519d4; PR landed via 68b34cb3) to:
#   (1) Count OPEN→FIXED flips (W44-50 wedge predicted closed; codec_wiki
#       + terminal cells expected to improve).
#   (2) Detect FIXED→OPEN regressions, especially on smooth-photo cells
#       where the gradient-predictor DC tree was expected to underperform
#       the WP fixed tree (W44-54 commit predicted 0369d229/097cb426
#       regressions; we don't carry those photos but 1418519 is the
#       analogous smooth-content member of our ledger corpus).

# ── HEADLINE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Pre-state  (W44-47 @ da08fd9b): 31 OPEN, 564 FIXED (of 595)
# Post-state (W44-55 @ 8006f486): 26 OPEN, 569 FIXED (of 595)
#
# Net flips: 6 OPEN → FIXED, 1 FIXED → OPEN, net −5 OPEN (−10 % of OPEN
# baseline; −16 % of OPEN-from-W44-1 baseline of 50 → 26 = −48 %).
#
# Session total vs W44-1 baseline (memory note
# cjxl_ledger_refresh_post_w44_3_w44_8_2026-05-19):
#   W44-1 baseline: 50 OPEN, 544 FIXED
#   W44-55 now:     26 OPEN, 569 FIXED (of 595, +1 row added W44-?)
#   Session total: 24 OPEN cells CLOSED, ~25 FIXED cells added or
#   reclassified across all W44-1..W44-55 chunks combined.

